  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1: find system account\n\n2: go to \"The In-Between\" world.\n\n3: it will automatically re-load the world every time you enter, do as fast as possible until you end up in a new world. (a \"Disconnected\" error should pop up)\n\n4: try to view current world information, the current world should be \"Error World\" and you can't see more info on it.",
